===Etymology===
From contraction of the phrase {{m|en|[[in]] [[as]] [[much]]|t=to such a degree}}, from {{inh|en|enm|[[in]] [[als]] [[mikel]]}}, a Northern form.<ref>{{R:Etymonline}}</ref>

===Pronunciation===
